  "prompt": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Giá đỡ ba chân được mở sao cho ba gốc chân cách đều nhau một khoảng bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>180</mn></semantics></math> cm. Biết các chân của giá đỡ bằng nhau và tạo thành một hình chóp tam giác đều có góc tạo bởi mặt bên và mặt đáy là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></semantics></math>. Hỏi chiều cao của giá đỡ bằng bao nhiêu mét?</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/b873c940097c21e3d0bee442011ab33c4a30b757ee6006dfe0d104579a9643f9.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
  "choices": [],
  "correct": "0.3",
  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Xét hình chóp tam giác đều <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> như hình vẽ bên.<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đều.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> là trọng tâm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> thì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>S</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đều nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>180</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> (cm).<br>Hơn nữa, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> là trọng tâm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> (cm).</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/b3e531ea250e693ba5f78e92395338eaf43b482ef1e598f9269346e05dc88415.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tXét <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math>, ta có\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>tan</mo><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇔</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>tan</mo><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><mo>tan</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> (cm)</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> (m).</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tVậy chiều cao của giá đỡ bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math> mét.",
